          "pebble_process_info_flags": 201,
          "name": "chalk",
          "description": "A rugged watchface inspired by the Garmin Instinct. It features a black & white theme with a historical information graph and a versatile miniature window.\r\n\r\nThe current time is prominently displayed on the watch face, and bisects four complication slots that can each be customized to display various combinations of the following data: \r\n- Weather (conditions & temperature) via Open-Meteo\r\n- Air pressure\r\n- Pressure trend\r\n- Elevation\r\n- Battery\r\n- Date\r\n- Custom time zone\r\n- Steps\r\n- Calories\r\n- Heart rate\r\n- Sunrise/sunset time\r\n- Sun position\r\n- Moon phase\r\n- Watch status",
